  "content": "<!doctype lake><meta name=\"doc-version\" content=\"1\" /><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"fixed\" /><meta name=\"typography\" content=\"classic\" /><h1 data-lake-id=\"UH0Zp\" id=\"UH0Zp\"><span data-lake-id=\"uf331e2de\" id=\"uf331e2de\" style=\"color: var(--yq-text-primary)\">摄像头使用-opencv</span></h1><p data-lake-id=\"u54ee50c2\" id=\"u54ee50c2\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ubc353737\" id=\"ubc353737\" class=\"lake-fontsize-22\" style=\"color: var(--yq-text-primary)\">1.泰山派板卡添加camera</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u456df908\" id=\"u456df908\" class=\"lake-fontsize-22\" style=\"color: var(--yq-text-primary)\"><br /></span><span data-lake-id=\"u86f03b70\" id=\"u86f03b70\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252)\">连接摄像头连接到usb接口,查看dev设备:</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%23%20%E5%9C%A8%E7%BB%88%E7%AB%AF%E4%B8%AD%E8%BE%93%E5%85%A5%E5%A6%82%E4%B8%8B%E5%91%BD%E4%BB%A4%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E6%9F%A5%E7%9C%8B%E5%88%B0camera%E8%AE%BE%E5%A4%87%E8%B5%84%E6%BA%90%EF%BC%9A%5Cnls%20%2Fdev%2Fvideo*%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22default%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A14%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22eASGA%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u5cc2918b\" id=\"u5cc2918b\"><span data-lake-id=\"u61036f1b\" id=\"u61036f1b\" class=\"lake-fontsize-11\" style=\"color: var(--yq-text-primary)\"><br /></span><span data-lake-id=\"u944b7e9a\" id=\"u944b7e9a\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252)\">检查板卡上的camera设备资源示例</span><span data-lake-id=\"uf86edf7a\" id=\"uf86edf7a\" class=\"lake-fontsize-11\" style=\"color: var(--yq-text-primary)\"><br /><br /></span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u13ebba64\" id=\"u13ebba64\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2023%2Fpng%2F27903758%2F1689238090657-b6dc906e-c550-4918-9eed-247b45211d04.png%3Fx-oss-process%3Dimage%252Fformat%252Cwebp%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22from%22%3A%22url%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A445%2C%22originHeight%22%3A64%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%232d281f%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22tinGz%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card></p><p data-lake-id=\"u53fa1c94\" id=\"u53fa1c94\"><span data-lake-id=\"ua965e1a1\" id=\"ua965e1a1\" class=\"lake-fontsize-11\" style=\"color: var(--yq-text-primary)\"><br /></span><span data-lake-id=\"u0dcca180\" id=\"u0dcca180\" class=\"lake-fontsize-11\" style=\"color: var(--yq-text-primary)\">也可以使用v4l2命令查看</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22v4l2-ctl%20--list-devices%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22default%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A14%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22zwTNY%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"uc38bb0e2\" id=\"uc38bb0e2\"><span data-lake-id=\"u349c4977\" id=\"u349c4977\" class=\"lake-fontsize-11\" style=\"color: var(--yq-text-primary)\"><br /></span><span data-lake-id=\"ue655cdf7\" id=\"ue655cdf7\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--yq-text-primary)\">v4l2-ctl --list-devices是一个命令行工具命令，用于列出系统中可用的视频设备列表及其相关信息。它是V4L2（Video for Linux Two）的一部分，用于查看和管理视频设备。</span><span data-lake-id=\"ubeb5913d\" id=\"ubeb5913d\" class=\"lake-fontsize-11\" style=\"color: var(--yq-text-primary)\"><br /></span><span data-lake-id=\"ucef4db52\" id=\"ucef4db52\" class=\"lake-fontsize-11\" style=\"color: var(--yq-text-primary)\">V4L2（Video for Linux Two）是Linux内核中的一个框架，用于支持视频设备的捕捉、显示和编解码等功能。它是Video4Linux的第二个版本。<br /><br /></span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u2854faa7\" id=\"u2854faa7\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2023%2Fpng%2F27903758%2F1689243265135-3c4954a3-bb22-4b1a-998f-59a2de84b9e5.png%3Fx-oss-process%3Dimage%252Fformat%252Cwebp%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22from%22%3A%22url%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A676%2C%22originHeight%22%3A557%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23161616%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22jMRwE%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card></p><p data-lake-id=\"uafc4495b\" id=\"uafc4495b\"><span data-lake-id=\"u0eb7e8ff\" id=\"u0eb7e8ff\" class=\"lake-fontsize-11\" style=\"color: var(--yq-text-primary)\"><br /></span><span data-lake-id=\"u0e56f4bf\" id=\"u0e56f4bf\" class=\"lake-fontsize-11\" style=\"color: var(--yq-text-primary)\">两个video:<br /></span><span data-lake-id=\"u61605be3\" id=\"u61605be3\" class=\"lake-fontsize-11\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">一个是图像/视频采集，一个是metadata采集</span><span data-lake-id=\"u43069905\" id=\"u43069905\" class=\"lake-fontsize-11\" style=\"color: var(--yq-text-primary)\"><br /></span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u41413572\" id=\"u41413572\" class=\"lake-fontsize-22\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">2.相关工具库安装</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u46228264\" id=\"u46228264\" class=\"lake-fontsize-22\" style=\"color: var(--yq-text-primary)\"><br /></span><span data-lake-id=\"u4f908a76\" id=\"u4f908a76\" class=\"lake-fontsize-11\" style=\"color: var(--yq-text-primary)\">安装opencv</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22pip3%20install%20opencv-python-headless%3D%3D4.6.0.66%5Cnpip3%20install%20opencv-python%3D%3D4.6.0.66%5Cnpip3%20install%20opencv-contrib-python%3D%3D4.6.0.66%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22default%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A14%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22NyLIH%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u0c86f364\" id=\"u0c86f364\"><span data-lake-id=\"u999cf4b0\" id=\"u999cf4b0\" class=\"lake-fontsize-11\" style=\"color: var(--yq-text-primary)\"><br /></span><span data-lake-id=\"uced8cbed\" id=\"uced8cbed\" class=\"lake-fontsize-11\" style=\"color: var(--yq-text-primary)\">验证是否安装成功</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22cat%40lubancat%3A~%24%20python3%5CnPython%203.8.10%20(default%2C%20Nov%2014%202022%2C%2012%3A59%3A47)%5Cn%5BGCC%209.4.0%5D%20on%20linux%5CnType%20%5C%22help%5C%22%2C%20%5C%22copyright%5C%22%2C%20%5C%22credits%5C%22%20or%20%5C%22license%5C%22%20for%20more%20information.%5Cn%3E%3E%3E%20import%20cv2%20as%20cv%5Cn%3E%3E%3E%20print(cv.__version__)%5Cn4.8.0%5Cn%3E%3E%3E%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22